# Model trust

- GGML / `.bin` model paths are loaded by native whisper.cpp — treat them as a
  **trust boundary**.
- Only load models from origins the user trusts; do not add helpers that
  download arbitrary remote weights without explicit trust documentation.
- Document process-crash risk with `# Abort` on `WhisperModel::load`.
- Keep large `*.bin` artifacts gitignored; do not commit model weights.
- Prefer quantized files (for example `*-q8_0.bin`) with `ComputeType::Int8`,
  and rely on load-time `model_ftype` validation.
